C-aENvktrMmqAQkWTA_N/view?usp=share_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@zenzaiumauma/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/19ca63ce/uploads/origins/5080a9b8-fb55-452a-8a05-e01c9c64b635?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=341f72af65cc70b1113fbc52b97b6882", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/19ca63ce/uploads/origins/5080a9b8-fb55-452a-8a05-e01c9c64b635?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=341f72af65cc70b1113fbc52b97b6882, https://si.imgix.net/19ca63ce/uploads/origins/5080a9b8-fb55-452a-8a05-e01c9c64b635?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f5f7a14c32557458143253ce8c66ed41 2x, https://si.imgix.net/19ca63ce/uploads/origins/5080a9b8-fb55-452a-8a05-e01c9c64b635?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7e7f15b7a2ba618a7e242fd4538decef 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello there! I think your art is very pretty\n\nI would like to request a picture of Snow White from Nikke\n\nhttps://twitter.com/NIKKE_en/status/1582174701702459392\nhttps://twitter.com/nikkeleakss/status/1652076381713342464\nhttps://imgur.com/a/XgBW93H\n\nI would like her full body shown.\n\nThe facial expression, pose, and scenario are up to you! \n\nPlease make her chest flat.\n\nHer thighs are very big and thick. No thigh gap.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@zenzaiumauma/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a6ad451c/uploads/origins/4034bae4-5abf-4a7b-bdf4-80860b21fc86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=31ac620d350fe481bd9e9426c7a16cf1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a6ad451c/uploads/origins/4034bae4-5abf-4a7b-bdf4-80860b21fc86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=31ac620d350fe481bd9e9426c7a16cf1, https://si.imgix.net/a6ad451c/uploads/origins/4034bae4-5abf-4a7b-bdf4-80860b21fc86?bg=%23fff